an also be challenging for avid gamers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm making this alone, with help from Trevron for the music, so don't hesitate to share and wishlist Lexispell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you'll enjoy :) - Eliptik</p>","developers":["MrEliptik"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053960/781e39fb2765641aff369457eab146b3dc5efce6/header.jpg?t=1768807410","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any 64bits linux distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core, 2Ghz or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 700 series or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any 64bits linux distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual core, 2Ghz or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 700 series or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053960/1686977266/e95f3a97a25c0f4b664ff339a5475f13dabfa516/1762095277/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762435796","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053960/1686977266/e95f3a97a25c0f4b664ff339a5475f13dabfa516/1762095277/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762435796","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053960/1686977266/e95f3a97a25c0f4b664ff339a5475f13dabfa516/1762095277/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762435796","id"